  "bio": "Ricardo is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Três Lagoas, Brazil, known for his exquisite illustrative tattoo work. His commitment to artistry has been recognized with awards in Ilha Solteira-Sp and Três Lagoas-Ms, ensuring that each design he creates is a masterpiece of detail and style. Ricardo's dedication to his craft is reflected in his clean and professional approach, making him a trusted name in the tattooing community.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Três Lagoas, Mato Grosso Do Sul, Brazil\n\nen Oviedo, Asturias\nRESPETO POR TU PIEL\nTatuador e Perfurador \nGrato",
